 "_event_rewards": "Item added to the return while the event runs (event_calendar.py event key -> lootId -> retriever code: [min, max]). darkorbitwiki events/chaos-omen: Chaos Fragment comes from Retriever Dispatch (R-01 5-10, R-02 10-20, R-03 15-25, R-04 20-30, R-05 35-50, R-06 65-80) and from Gate Dispatch; no quantity is given for the gate: 'gate' uses the R-01 range (adaptation). It continues in Protegit Pandemonium too (ETKINLIKLER-27); the quantities are not affected by the Dispatch Day multiplier.",
 "_source": "Reward lists, slot prices, Dispatch Day (Monday, Friday) and gate dispatch (1 GGEU, the gate installed at wave 1) from the wiki (darkorbitwiki.com/dispatch-retriever, /dispatch-gate; belgeler/arastirma/sistemler_modlar.md 1.15). Adaptation (the wiki gives no quantities or probabilities): in each dispatch reward_count different rewards from the list; quantity base_count x (1 + tier_increase x (tier-1)), single ones 1; rare ones have a low selection weight; on Dispatch Day quantities x1.5; gate dispatch 1 hour. According to the real server recording (20261025_152841_gercek): 4 different random items per return and fixed items (fixed); tier 1 quantities from the recording (Scrap 2, Mucosum 8, Tetrathrin 1, Bifenon 4, Polychromium 6, each alloy 1); quantities of items not in the recording are adaptation. Event rewards: event_rewards.",
